abstract: "Independent research manuscript / preprint draft, not peer-reviewed. Protocol frozen by the owner on 2026-11-24. One confirmatory experiment complete (EXP-003: Llama 3.1 8B Q8_0 minus Q4_K_M strict accuracy +1.67 pp, 95 % CI [-1.00, +4.33], exact McNemar p = 0.332; no detected difference, not equivalence); EXP-001 and EXP-002 failed before any request on Ollama 0.9.6 and were rerun unchanged on Ollama 0.40.6 with the owner's approval (EXP-002 complete; EXP-001 ran in full but met a frozen stopping criterion after the fact, status pending the owner). Repository URL: [OWNER PLACEHOLDER: repository URL, not published]."
